  "body_html": "<h1>toValuation_mono</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma toValuation_mono [DecidableEq G] (w : AdditiveValuation N G) (hnn : ∀ (i : N) (g : G), 0 ≤ w.weight i g) (i : N) {S T : Finset G} (h : T ⊆ S) : w.toValuation.val i T ≤ w.toValuation.val i S</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>toValuation</li>\n</ul>",
